          "accept": ["mu"],
          "reject": [
            {
              "answer": "mı",
              "why": "Each particle copies the last vowel of the word before it: *soğuk* ends in u, so *mu*."
            },
            {
              "answer": "mü",
              "why": "u in *soğuk* is a back vowel, so the particle is *mu*, not *mü*."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "hint": "Look at the last vowel of *sıcak*, then of *soğuk*.",
      "explain": "Each particle follows the word right before it: *sıcak mı*, *soğuk mu*. Two questions side by side ask **or**."
